  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Summons a lightning tornado on any hex in range for four rounds, dealing 2d4 + {{math spellPower \"*\" 3}} damage in a 1.5 m radius and guaranteeing a Stun at its centre.</p><p>At the start of each round it moves twice, one hex at a time, in a random direction. Roll 1d6 for the direction, counting clockwise from the top hex. A target can only take its damage once per round.</p><p>When Chaining triggers, the caster picks one creature the tornado has hit. The chain cannot target a creature the tornado has already hit.</p>",
